      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تسبّى لَهُ</span></b>  (assumed tropical:)  <i>He manifested,</i> or <i>showed, love,</i>
or <i>affection, to him;</i> and <i>became inclined to him.</i>
